sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Preparador
    actor C as Coordinador
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant APP as Caso de uso
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    P->>API: POST /publication-versions/{id}/submit
    API->>APP: SubmitVersion(principal, id)
    APP->>DB: Bloquear versión y verificar revisión jurídica
    APP->>DB: Congelar snapshot + transición
    DB-->>API: PENDING_APPROVAL
    C->>API: POST /publication-versions/{id}/decision
    API->>APP: Decide(principal, id, APPROVE)
    APP->>DB: Verificar cuenta/persona != preparadores
    APP->>DB: Registrar aprobación de hash + transición
    DB-->>API: APPROVED
    C->>API: POST /publication-versions/{id}/publish
    API->>APP: Publish(principal, id)
    APP->>DB: BEGIN + FOR UPDATE
    APP->>DB: Validar approved, hash, mismo cliente/seguimiento
    APP->>DB: UPDATE versión PUBLISHED + current_version_id + auditoría
    alt Commit correcto
        DB-->>API: COMMIT, PUBLISHED
        API-->>C: 200 PUBLISHED
    else Error de commit
        DB-->>API: ROLLBACK
        API-->>C: Error sanitizado, no publicación
    end
